{"unit_id":"happyren__dsh-agent-messaging#card-zh","repo":"happyren/dsh-agent-messaging","commit":"80071ff741cc6f189f89b140bd52fd269ed687f3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Agent Messaging（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：让不同 DSH 智能体会话互相发现并交换消息，减少重复工作和相互矛盾。它在 DSH 注册 peer_list、peer_send 等工具，并将收到的消息按接收策略交给会话处理；Web 端还会在对话记录中显示独立消息卡片。主要功能包括跨会话发送、离线消息暂存、工作认领、交叉核验和共享决策记录。适合需要多个会话协作开发或分工处理任务的 DSH 用户。基础本机通信不需要额外账号或密钥；可选配置 A2A 外部端点。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:230-250","src/client/index.ts:24-42","src/app/receive-message.ts:42-72"]}
{"unit_id":"happyren__dsh-agent-messaging#card-en","repo":"happyren/dsh-agent-messaging","commit":"80071ff741cc6f189f89b140bd52fd269ed687f3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Agent Messaging connects DSH sessions for peer messaging and coordination. Tools support peer discovery, work claims, verification, task status, and shared decisions. Offline messages wait for the recipient’s next start. A Web card displays incoming messages. Local use needs no extra account or key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:230-250","src/client/index.ts:24-42","src/app/receive-message.ts:42-72"]}
